OL,3,GNEWSACare review leaves questions
OL,4,Aunanswered, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of children with complex
OL,7,Fdisabilities say a review into a
OL,8,Ftherapy service has failed to answer
OL,9,Fkey questions about their children's
OL,10,Fcare.
OL,12,FThe report identified failings
OL,13,Fincluding staffing shortages and
OL,14,Fcommunication breakdowns within Sirona
OL,15,FCare & Health's children's therapy
OL,16,Fservice. But families say it does not
OL,17,Ffully address the issues that led them
OL,18,Fto speak out.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
