OL,3,GNEWSACare review leaves questions
OL,4,Aunanswered, parents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Sirona chief executive
OL,7,FJo Beer said it was a "balanced
OL,8,Fassessment" and the organisation was
OL,9,Ffocused on "learning and improving".
OL,11,FThe BBC has also spoken to two Sirona
OL,12,Femployees, who asked not to be
OL,13,Fidentified, who alleged that
OL,14,Fcost-cutting may have impacted on care
OL,15,Fand experienced staff had left due to
OL,16,Fstress.
